> **Note:** This is for educational and authorized security testing purposes only. Always ensure you have proper authorization before testing on any system.

## Overview

The Commons-Collections 1 (CC1) gadget chain exploits `TransformingComparator` and `InvokerTransformer` to achieve arbitrary code execution during deserialization. It requires:
- **commons-collections** version < 3.2.2 or < 4.0 (with unsafe deserialization enabled)
- **JDK** version < 8u191 (or with `sun.misc.Unsafe` accessible)

